Five Web Browsers & Rendering Engines
Browser	Rendering Engine
Google Chrome	Blink
Microsoft Edge	Blink
Mozilla Firefox	Gecko
Apple Safari	WebKit
Opera	Blink
How They Differ

Blink (Chrome/Edge/Opera): Fast, highly optimized, modern web features.

Gecko (Firefox): Independent engine with strong standards support.

WebKit (Safari): Focused on Apple devices and low battery consumption.
